    "voice_type": "none",
    "focus_object": "",
    "emotion": "Neutral",
    "source_text": "苏念站在浴室的镜子前。"
  },
  {
    "beat_id": 2,
    "space": "Physical",
    "characters_present": [
      "Su Nian",
      "Lin Ke",
      "grandmother"
    ],
    "primary_char": "Su Nian",
    "action_visual": "Su Nian rinses",
    "spoken_dialogue": "",
    "dialogue_speaker": "",
    "inner_voice": "",
    "voice_type": "none",
    "focus_object": "",
    "emotion": "Neutral",
    "source_text": "她刚洗完脸。水珠还挂在下巴上，顺着脖子滑进衣领。毛巾搭在肩膀上，她没擦。"
  },
  {
    "beat_id": 3,
    "space": "Physical",
    "characters_present": [
      "Su Nian",
      "Lin Ke",
      "grandmother"
    ],
    "primary_char": "Su Nian",
    "action_visual": "Su Nian gazes at the mirror",
    "spoken_dialogue": "",
    "dialogue_speaker": "",
    "inner_voice": "",
    "voice_type": "none",
    "focus_object": "",
    "emotion": "Neutral",
    "source_text": "她在看镜子里的那个人。\n圆脸。齐肩短发。眼睛下面有淡淡的青色——昨晚没睡好。嘴唇有点干，咬过的地方有一小块破皮。\n她认识这张脸。\n但她不确定，这张脸——是她自己"
  },
  {
    "beat_id": 4,
    "space": "Physical",
    "characters_present": [
      "Su Nian",
      "Lin Ke",
      "grandmother"
    ],
    "primary_char": "Su Nian",
    "action_visual": "Su Nian reaches out to touch gently",
    "spoken_dialogue": "",
    "dialogue_speaker": "",
    "inner_voice": "",
    "voice_type": "none",
    "focus_object": "",
    "emotion": "Neutral",
    "source_text": "苏念伸手摸了摸镜子。指尖碰到冰凉的玻璃表面，镜子里的人也伸出手。两根手指隔着一层玻璃，对在一起。\n她记得自己的名字。苏念。二十六岁。念想咖啡店的店主。\n她记得咖"
  },
  {
    "beat_id": 5,
    "space": "Physical",
    "characters_present": [
      "Su Nian",
      "Lin Ke",
      "grandmother"
    ],
    "primary_char": "Su Nian",
    "action_visual": "Su Nian walks out the door",
    "spoken_dialogue": "小念满月，妈妈抱着。",
    "dialogue_speaker": "Su Nian",
    "inner_voice": "",
    "voice_type": "onscreen",
    "focus_object": "handwriting",
    "emotion": "Mystery",
    "source_text": "她走出浴室，拿起手机。相册里有一个文件夹叫\"家人\"。她点开。\n第一张：一个年轻女人抱着婴儿。女人的脸——模糊。不是照片质量差，是脸的部分像被水泡过，只剩下一个轮"
  },
  {
    "beat_id": 6,
    "space": "Physical",
    "characters_present": [
      "Gu Shen"
    ],
    "primary_char": "Gu Shen",
    "action_visual": "Gu Shen gazes at the photo",
    "spoken_dialogue": "",
    "dialogue_speaker": "",
    "inner_voice": "",
    "voice_type": "none",
    "focus_object": "old photo",
    "emotion": "Mystery",
    "source_text": "第二张：一个男人站在公园里。背景是一棵大榕树。男人的脸——空白。不是被遮挡，是不存在。照片上只有衣服和背景，头部的位置是一片肉色的模糊。"
  },
  {
    "beat_id": 7,
    "space": "Physical",
    "characters_present": [
      "Su Nian",
      "Gu Shen",
      "Lin Ke",
      "Chen Rui",
      "Su Yuan",
      "grandmother"
    ],
    "primary_char": "Su Nian",
    "action_visual": "Su Nian stares intently",
    "spoken_dialogue": "",
    "dialogue_speaker": "",
    "inner_voice": "",
    "voice_type": "none",
    "focus_object": "old photo",
    "emotion": "Neutral",
    "source_text": "苏念的手指在照片上停了三秒。她想不起来这个男人叫什么。她知道他是她的父亲——因为外婆说过。但他的名字、他的声音、他的脸——全是空白。\n第三张：外婆。照片是清晰的"
  },
  {
    "beat_id": 8,
    "space": "Physical",
    "characters_present": [
      "Su Nian",
      "Lin Ke",
      "grandmother"
    ],
    "primary_char": "grandmother",
    "action_visual": "grandmother draws latte art in the foam",
    "spoken_dialogue": "",
    "dialogue_speaker": "",
    "inner_voice": "",
    "voice_type": "none",
    "focus_object": "sticky note",
    "emotion": "Neutral",
    "source_text": "她想不起来了。\n她记得外婆的便签。记得外婆的咖啡配方。记得外婆教她拉花时手把手的温度。"
  },
  {
    "beat_id": 9,
    "space": "Physical",
    "characters_present": [
      "Su Nian",
      "Lin Ke",
      "grandmother"
    ],
    "primary_char": "Su Nian",
    "action_visual": "Su Nian stands still, shoulders slightly tense, eyes unfocused",
    "spoken_dialogue": "",
    "dialogue_speaker": "",
    "inner_voice": "",
    "voice_type": "none",
    "focus_object": "",
    "emotion": "Neutral",
    "source_text": "但声音——没了。\n像有人把她脑子里的音频文件删了，只留下了图片。"
  },
  {
    "beat_id": 10,
    "space": "Physical",
    "characters_present": [
      "Su Nian",
      "Gu Shen",
      "Lin Ke",
      "Chen Rui",
      "grandmother"
    ],
    "primary_char": "Su Nian",
    "action_visual": "Su Nian sets the cup down on the counter",
    "spoken_dialogue": "想不起来",
    "dialogue_speaker": "Su Nian",
    "inner_voice": "",
    "voice_type": "onscreen",
    "focus_object": "",
    "emotion": "Sadness",
    "source_text": "苏念放下手机。她走到吧台后面，给自己泡了一杯咖啡。手在动，但她的注意力不在咖啡上。\n她在想——她还记得什么？\n她记得林可。记得顾深。记得陈锐。记得咖啡店的每一个"
  },
