    ],
    "primary_char": "Lin Ke",
    "action_visual": "Lin Ke gazes at the sticky note",
    "spoken_dialogue": "",
    "dialogue_speaker": "",
    "inner_voice": "",
    "voice_type": "none",
    "focus_object": "sticky note",
    "emotion": "Neutral",
    "source_text": "她走到墙边，看着那些便签。外婆的便签、客人写的便签、林可画的小画。"
  },
  {
    "beat_id": 15,
    "space": "Physical",
    "characters_present": [
      "Su Nian",
      "Lin Ke",
      "grandmother"
    ],
    "primary_char": "grandmother",
    "action_visual": "grandmother reaches out to touch gently",
    "spoken_dialogue": "",
    "dialogue_speaker": "",
    "inner_voice": "",
    "voice_type": "none",
    "focus_object": "sticky note",
    "emotion": "Mystery",
    "source_text": "她伸手摸了摸外婆那张便签。\"念\"字的最后一笔，又淡了。\n她记得昨天这张便签上——\"念\"字是完整的。"
  },
  {
    "beat_id": 16,
    "space": "Physical",
    "characters_present": [
      "Su Nian"
    ],
    "primary_char": "Su Nian",
    "action_visual": "Su Nian stands still, shoulders slightly tense, eyes unfocused",
    "spoken_dialogue": "",
    "dialogue_speaker": "",
    "inner_voice": "",
    "voice_type": "none",
    "focus_object": "",
    "emotion": "Neutral",
    "source_text": "现在少了一笔。"
  },
  {
    "beat_id": 17,
    "space": "Physical",
    "characters_present": [
      "Su Nian"
    ],
    "primary_char": "Su Nian",
    "action_visual": "Su Nian flips through the sticky note",
    "spoken_dialogue": "",
    "dialogue_speaker": "",
    "inner_voice": "",
    "voice_type": "none",
    "focus_object": "sticky note",
    "emotion": "Neutral",
    "source_text": "苏念把便签揭下来，翻到背面。"
  },
  {
    "beat_id": 18,
    "space": "Physical",
    "characters_present": [
      "Su Nian"
    ],
    "primary_char": "Su Nian",
    "action_visual": "Su Nian sees something",
    "spoken_dialogue": "",
    "dialogue_speaker": "",
    "inner_voice": "小念，如果你看到这行字，说明你已经忘了什么。别怕。有些东西不在脑子里，在杯子里。",
    "voice_type": "inner_voice",
    "focus_object": "",
    "emotion": "Neutral",
    "source_text": "那行小字还在：*\"小念，如果你看到这行字，说明你已经忘了什么。别怕。有些东西不在脑子里，在杯子里。\"*\n\"在杯子里\"。"
  },
  {
    "beat_id": 19,
    "space": "Physical",
    "characters_present": [
      "Su Nian",
      "Lin Ke",
      "grandmother"
    ],
    "primary_char": "Su Nian",
    "action_visual": "Su Nian sits down",
    "spoken_dialogue": "",
    "dialogue_speaker": "",
    "inner_voice": "小念，别再喝了。",
    "voice_type": "inner_voice",
    "focus_object": "cup wall",
    "emotion": "Mystery",
    "source_text": "苏念看着手里的咖啡杯。杯壁上的咖啡渍在灯光下形成一个不规则的图案。\n她把杯子端到眼前。\n图案变了。\n不是咖啡渍——是一个画面。模糊的，像旧电视的雪花屏。画面里有"
  },
  {
    "beat_id": 20,
    "space": "Physical",
    "characters_present": [
      "Su Nian",
      "grandmother"
    ],
    "primary_char": "Su Nian",
    "action_visual": "Su Nian hears a sound",
    "spoken_dialogue": "",
    "dialogue_speaker": "",
    "inner_voice": "你喝得越多，忘得越多。忘得越多，喝得越多。停下来。",
    "voice_type": "inner_voice",
    "focus_object": "",
    "emotion": "Neutral",
    "source_text": "和昨天一样的声音。外婆的声音。\n但这次，苏念听到了后面的话：\n*\"你喝得越多，忘得越多。忘得越多，喝得越多。停下来。\"*"
  },
  {
    "beat_id": 21,
    "space": "Mental",
    "characters_present": [
      "Su Nian",
      "Lin Ke",
      "grandmother"
    ],
    "primary_char": "Su Nian",
    "action_visual": "Su Nian gazes at the coffee cup",
    "spoken_dialogue": "",
    "dialogue_speaker": "",
    "inner_voice": "",
    "voice_type": "none",
    "focus_object": "watercolor painting",
    "emotion": "Neutral",
    "source_text": "画面碎了。咖啡杯在苏念手里裂开了一道纹。热咖啡从裂缝里渗出来，烫了她的手指。\n苏念松开手。杯子掉在地上，碎了。咖啡洒了一地，溅在她的拖鞋上。\n她蹲在地上，看着那"
  },
  {
    "beat_id": 22,
    "space": "Physical",
    "characters_present": [
      "Su Nian",
      "Lin Ke",
      "grandmother"
    ],
    "primary_char": "Su Nian",
    "action_visual": "the phone buzzes on the counter",
    "spoken_dialogue": "",
    "dialogue_speaker": "",
    "inner_voice": "",
    "voice_type": "none",
    "focus_object": "",
    "emotion": "Neutral",
    "source_text": "手机响了。\n她没接。"
  },
  {
    "beat_id": 23,
    "space": "Physical",
    "characters_present": [
      "Su Nian"
    ],
    "primary_char": "Su Nian",
    "action_visual": "the phone buzzes on the counter",
    "spoken_dialogue": "",
    "dialogue_speaker": "",
    "inner_voice": "",
    "voice_type": "none",
    "focus_object": "",
    "emotion": "Neutral",
    "source_text": "手机又响了。"
  },
  {
    "beat_id": 24,
    "space": "Physical",
    "characters_present": [
      "Su Nian",
      "Lin Ke",
      "grandmother"
    ],
    "primary_char": "Lin Ke",
    "action_visual": "Lin Ke stands up from the seat",
    "spoken_dialogue": "",
    "dialogue_speaker": "",
    "inner_voice": "",
    "voice_type": "none",
    "focus_object": "",
    "emotion": "Neutral",
    "source_text": "她站起来，走到吧台后面，拿起手机。屏幕上显示\"林可\"。"
  },
  {
    "beat_id": 25,
    "space": "Physical",
    "characters_present": [
      "Su Nian"
    ],
    "primary_char": "Su Nian",
    "action_visual": "Su Nian stands still, shoulders slightly tense, eyes unfocused",
    "spoken_dialogue": "",
    "dialogue_speaker": "",
    "inner_voice": "",
    "voice_type": "none",
    "focus_object": "",
    "emotion": "Neutral",
    "source_text": "\"喂。\"苏念的声音有点哑。"
  },
  {
    "beat_id": 26,
    "space": "Physical",
    "characters_present": [
      "Su Nian",
      "Lin Ke"
    ],
    "primary_char": "Su Nian",
    "action_visual": "Su Nian sees something",
    "spoken_dialogue": "苏念！",
    "dialogue_speaker": "Su Nian",
    "inner_voice": "",
    "voice_type": "onscreen",
    "focus_object": "",
    "emotion": "Neutral",
    "source_text": "\"苏念！\"林可的声音很急，\"你看到新闻了吗？老城区要拆迁了！你们那条巷子——全拆！\""
  },
  {
    "beat_id": 27,
    "space": "Physical",
    "characters_present": [
      "Su Nian",
      "Lin Ke",
      "grandmother"
    ],
    "primary_char": "Su Nian",
    "action_visual": "Su Nian clenches fists tightly",
    "spoken_dialogue": "我知道。",
    "dialogue_speaker": "Su Nian",
    "inner_voice": "",
    "voice_type": "onscreen",
    "focus_object": "",
    "emotion": "Tension",
    "source_text": "苏念的手攥紧了手机。\n\"我知道。\"她说。"
  },
  {
    "beat_id": 28,
    "space": "Physical",
    "characters_present": [
      "Lin Ke"
    ],
    "primary_char": "Lin Ke",
    "action_visual": "Lin Ke stands still, shoulders slightly tense, eyes unfocused",
    "spoken_dialogue": "你——你知道？",
    "dialogue_speaker": "Lin Ke",
    "inner_voice": "",
    "voice_type": "onscreen",
    "focus_object": "",
    "emotion": "Neutral",
    "source_text": "\"你——你知道？\"林可的声音顿了一下，\"你怎么知道的？新闻刚出来十分钟！\""
  },
  {
    "beat_id": 29,
    "space": "Physical",
    "characters_present": [
      "Su Nian"
    ],
    "primary_char": "Su Nian",
    "action_visual": "Su Nian stands still, shoulders slightly tense, eyes unfocused",
    "spoken_dialogue": "",
    "dialogue_speaker": "",
    "inner_voice": "",
    "voice_type": "none",
    "focus_object": "",
    "emotion": "Neutral",
    "source_text": "苏念没回答。"
  },
  {
    "beat_id": 30,
    "space": "Physical",
    "characters_present": [
      "Su Nian",
      "Lin Ke",
      "grandmother"
    ],
    "primary_char": "Su Nian",
    "action_visual": "Su Nian trembles visibly",
    "spoken_dialogue": "苏念？",
    "dialogue_speaker": "Su Nian",
    "inner_voice": "",
    "voice_type": "onscreen",
    "focus_object": "",
    "emotion": "Tension",
    "source_text": "\"苏念？\"\n\"我在。\"苏念说。她的声音很平，但她的另一只手在发抖。\"林可，我问你一个问题。\"\n\"你说。\"\n\"我爸妈——长什么样？\""
  },
  {
    "beat_id": 31,
    "space": "Physical",
    "characters_present": [
      "Su Nian"
    ],
    "primary_char": "Su Nian",
    "action_visual": "Su Nian speaks softly",
    "spoken_dialogue": "苏念，你在说什么？",
    "dialogue_speaker": "Su Nian",
    "inner_voice": "",
    "voice_type": "onscreen",
    "focus_object": "",
    "emotion": "Neutral",
    "source_text": "电话那头沉默了三秒。\n\"苏念，你在说什么？\""
  },
  {
    "beat_id": 32,
    "space": "Physical",
    "characters_present": [
      "Su Nian",
      "Gu Shen",
      "Lin Ke",
      "Chen Rui",
      "Su Yuan",
      "grandmother"
    ],
    "primary_char": "Su Nian",
    "action_visual": "Su Nian tears roll down cheeks",
    "spoken_dialogue": "我不记得了。",
    "dialogue_speaker": "Su Nian",
    "inner_voice": "",
    "voice_type": "onscreen",
    "focus_object": "",
    "emotion": "Sadness",
    "source_text": "\"我不记得了。\"苏念说。她的声音没有哭腔，但她的手指在手机壳上抠出了痕迹。\"我不记得他们的脸。不记得他们的声音。不记得他们叫什么名字。\"\n\"苏念——\"\n\"我也不"
  },
  {
    "beat_id": 33,
    "space": "Physical",
    "characters_present": [
      "Su Nian",
      "Lin Ke",
      "grandmother"
    ],
    "primary_char": "Su Nian",
    "action_visual": "Su Nian speaks softly",
    "spoken_dialogue": "",
    "dialogue_speaker": "",
    "inner_voice": "你哥哥当年也是这样。",
    "voice_type": "inner_voice",
    "focus_object": "",
    "emotion": "Neutral",
    "source_text": "电话那头，林可的呼吸声很重。\n然后她说了一句话。声音很轻，但苏念听得清清楚楚：\n*\"你哥哥当年也是这样。\"*"
  },
  {
    "beat_id": 34,
    "space": "Physical",
    "characters_present": [
      "Su Nian"
    ],
    "primary_char": "Su Nian",
    "action_visual": "Su Nian hand pauses mid-motion",
    "spoken_dialogue": "什么？",
    "dialogue_speaker": "Su Nian",
    "inner_voice": "",
    "voice_type": "onscreen",
    "focus_object": "",
    "emotion": "Neutral",
    "source_text": "苏念的手停了。\n\"什么？\""
  },
  {
    "beat_id": 35,
    "space": "Physical",
    "characters_present": [
      "Gu Shen",
      "Lin Ke",
      "Chen Rui",
      "Su Yuan"
    ],
    "primary_char": "Lin Ke",
    "action_visual": "Lin Ke trembles visibly",
    "spoken_dialogue": "你哥哥——",
    "dialogue_speaker": "Lin Ke",
    "inner_voice": "",
    "voice_type": "onscreen",
    "focus_object": "",
    "emotion": "Tension",
    "source_text": "\"你哥哥——\"林可的声音在发抖，\"他也有过这种'能力'。他也能听到别人听不到的东西。但代价——\""
  },
  {
    "beat_id": 36,
    "space": "Physical",
    "characters_present": [
      "Su Nian"
    ],
    "primary_char": "Su Nian",
    "action_visual": "Su Nian stands still, shoulders slightly tense, eyes unfocused",
    "spoken_dialogue": "",
    "dialogue_speaker": "",
    "inner_voice": "",
    "voice_type": "none",
    "focus_object": "",
    "emotion": "Neutral",
    "source_text": "电话断了。"
  },
  {
    "beat_id": 37,
    "space": "Physical",
    "characters_present": [
      "Su Nian",
      "Lin Ke"
    ],
    "primary_char": "Su Nian",
    "action_visual": "the call disconnects",
    "spoken_dialogue": "",
    "dialogue_speaker": "",
